        "text_tNNyqd": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The pandemic and ensuing economic challenges have affected nearly every industry, and the food and beverage industry is no exception. As consumers look to save money and spend more time at home, they’re spending less time in restaurants—and more time preparing their own meals. Savvy food and beverage companies are looking for ways to differentiate their offerings to attract more customers. </p>",
            "text_size": "text-base"
          }
        }
      },
